# Working files that should not be served from emr-inc.net.

# The row level dispatch record (2026-09-28). It used to be linked for download
# from the open data page; it is not published any more. One row per radio
# transmission, located to the street, is a different kind of disclosure from the
# aggregate counts this site publishes, and not one we want to make. Excluding it
# here is what actually stops it being served: taking the link out of the HTML
# only hides it, the URL stays fetchable.
#
# This does NOT break the rebuild. data/build-dispatch-views.py reads the CSV from
# the repository checkout inside GitHub Actions, never over HTTP from the site, so
# the Monday/Wednesday/Friday redraw is unaffected by its absence here.
data/dispatch-events.csv

DESIGN-BRIEF.md
MIGRATION.md
build-standalone.py
*-standalone.html
experiments/
dns/
